  Usage : {% render 'knr-icon', icon: 'chevron' %}
  Icônes : chevron (8×4), plus (16×16), grip (12×12), cross (11×11),
  pin, search, bag (16×16), user (18×18), facebook, instagram, tiktok, linkedin (20×20)
{%- endcomment -%}
